Cell["\<\
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]path\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] should be an ordered list \
of pairs of vertices, i.e. edges, that form the desired Laplacian RW.
If \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]draw\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is true, then draw the \
path\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.946453940925895*^9, 3.946453996545616*^9}, {
