Cell["\<\
The symmetry factor comes from: 
1) restriction to one quadrant: 4x2, i.e. choice to go Down than Right
2) an extra x2 from the choice between going straight after the first Right \
turn, or to turn Left and go down again \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9949058988158264`*^9, 
  3.994906057929825*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8b27b8e6-2a5b-b344-b074-\
e38de3fbaa0a"],

